QUESTIONS={
 'arcane-tether':'Preserve one object or ally and10minute location sense. Define willing/attended target, sensing distance and precision, same-location versus movement information, obstruction, concentration and maximum links. Loss/suppression and transfer do not provide remote sight, creature identification, plane/origin knowledge, command or tracking of an unrelated object.',
 'glyph-trace':'Define actual magical-rune/sigil eligibility and what reveal/highlight supplies within30ft, including concealed writing, sight/cover, active versus inert marks and disputed magic. Set highlight duration despite Instantaneous and M/F material handling. This does not translate, identify a complete spell, disarm a trap, bypass access or invent a rune.',
 'momentary-pause':'Source says you act first on an initiative tie but Core gives Action/30ft/Instantaneous. Set self target, pre-initiative duration and tie-resolution checkpoint, including several users and current tie authority. No mid-order extra turn, retroactive action, surprise removal, new initiative roll or Time Loop activation.',
 'spectral-quill':'Define actual remote writing/drawing surface, implement/ink requirement, amount and speed per cast, visible access, movement and duration. Perfect clarity is legibility of known intended content, not perfect knowledge, language, forgery, copied spells, free materials or formal crafting/formula progress. Resolve whether any physical quill exists and its custody/end.',
 'cantrip-echo':'Preserve BonusAction repeat of a cast cantrip. Define whose eligible prior cantrip, timing/window, actual access and all components/targets, original success/countering status and replay scaling. Establish one legal cast transaction and action cost without double charging the same BonusAction, self-echo recursion or infinite free chains. Retain cadence, Refrain, concentration and cast hooks.',
 'magical-ping':'Define all active magical effects in the10ft burst using actual range/origin, barriers, suppression and finite information output. Distinguish presence/count/location from spell identity, caster, hidden lore and nonmagical source names. No automatic dispel, hostile intent test or immunity to magic that explicitly defeats detection.',
 'light':'Preserve an actual object emitting20ft bright light; reconcile Core20ft range and Instantaneous with effect lifetime. Define target size, attended resistance, number of lights, color, covering, movement, end and interaction with darkness. Do not silently add dim-light radius, heat, fire, daylight, permanent value or a different Mage Light spell.',
 'mage-hand':'Define a finite spectral manipulation effect at30ft: object mass/size, attended resistance, actual sight, motion, manipulation actions, lifetime/concentration and release placement. Distinguish genuine object movement from illusions and creature summons. No unprinted attack, tool proficiency, spell component hand, magic-item activation, infinite cargo or telekinetic body carrying.',
 'true-strike':'Preserve advantage on your next attack roll, but Core resolution says Spell attack. Explicitly decide whether that is delivery or an erroneous generic field, target/self scope, duration, consumption and one-use timing. No self-consuming delivery ambiguity, bonus attack, inherited external redesign, damage modifier or bypass of advantage cancellation.',
 'arcane-mark':'Define actual personal rune, target/surface, size, visibility, duration, concentration, removal/suppression and maximum outstanding marks. Distinguish it from Shadow Mark and Rune Carving. A personal design supplies no unforgeable identity certificate, remote sensor, tracking beacon, trap, magical credential or free crafted artifact.',
 'spellshift':'Preserve changing one spell damage type. Define affected actual cast owner, eligible finite input/output damage types, timing before commitment/result, multi-component damage scope, duration and resource cost. Resolve immunity/resistance and source-specific damage hooks without altering healing, conditions, targeting, summon attacks or creating retroactive/multiple stacked type changes.',
 'ritual-anchor':'Preserve10minute casting and fixing a ritual location for long-distance use. Identify actual legal ritual procedures and finite distance/duration/anchor identity, recipient consent, materials, sight/line and concentration responsibilities. It grants no ritual repertoire, free paid costs, new cosmic links or unspecified universal remote casting; missing ritual dependencies need explicit disposition.',
 'resonance-tether':'Retain catalog name and possible Mana Tether alias separately until joint disposition. Define two willing actual casters, duration, who channels, casting origin versus recipient, sight/range, actual turns/actions/components, interruption and concentration. One real caster retains access, RP/cadence/hook ownership; no pooled-resource duplication, remote-target omniscience or free proxy turn.',
 'delay-spell':'Preserve holding one spell up to6seconds. Define attachment cast/timing, eligible source spell, beginning and later effect checkpoints, target/geometry locking or reevaluation, concentration, interruption and expiry. Separate it from Ready; no repeated spellcasting/cost refunds, extra Actions/Reactions or automatic delayed hostile spell capture.',
 'flare-sigil':'Define marked target eligibility/resistance, finite waiting duration and which next actual spell effect triggers glow. Set glow radius, lifetime, visibility and hidden/invisible interaction, consumption on countered/missed/no-effect casts and multiple marks. The source does not automatically grant attack advantage, hostile detection, damage or true sight.',
 'magic-thread':'Define a finite minor effect menu or actual eligible parent spell, touch/word trigger identity, number of stored uses, duration, activation cost, event ordering and resources paid. Preserve components/access and historical cast ownership. No generic stored high-rank spell, autonomous sensor, permanent reusable enchanted item or recursive triggering engine.',
 'quick-cast':'Source reduces one Action spell to BonusAction once while Quick Cast itself is a BonusAction. Explicitly settle whether it prepares a later turn or modifies the same BonusAction transaction, its expiry, eligible rank/owner and all costs. Do not silently grant two BonusActions or an unprinted free preparation. Maintain actual cast count, cadence, interruption and concentration.',
 'arcane-portal':'Define a temporary door between two seen points, endpoints within actual30ft rules, portal size/orientation, duration/concentration, allowed traffic and movement/action cost. Account for cargo, elevation, falls, obstruction and occupied destinations. Core Planar tag alone grants no cross-plane travel or cosmology review. No unbounded mass flow or arbitrary sight through a portal.',
 'spell-mirror':'Preserve first spell targeting you redirected to its original caster. Set self scope, lifetime, eligible spell ranks/types, selection when area/multitarget/channels occur, legal new-target constraints, save/attack owner and reflection ordering. Define miss/counter/invalid-redirection consumption and finite mutual-reflection termination without new casts or duplicated effects.',
 'thread-tap':'Preserve information on one ongoing spell: caster,power,intent. Define target identification/range, resistance, exact finite answers available from the actual effect, unknown/unidentifiable information and ongoing-spell boundary. Distinguish spell purpose at casting from reading current private thoughts. No automatic truth beyond source information, retroactive caster location or cosmology disclosure.',
 'echo-cast':'Preserve next-round repetition up toTier2 and both catalog RP-cost versus Core base-RP-cost wordings. Explicitly bind Tier to the game current rank/grade system and settle allowed original cast, access, timing/action, materials, strain/additional costs, cadence/concentration and result. Prevent Echo-of-Echo/other copying recursion and refunds from zero base cost without weakening the promised finite replay.',
 'continual-flame':'Preserve permanent flame needing no oxygen,10minute cast and UntilDispelled. Define actual target, brightness/area and heat/ignition versus purely visual effect, extinguishing/suppression, movement/cover and count limits. No automatic food/forge power, daylight, artifact fuel, sale value or damage menu is supplied; any such completion needs explicit scope.',
 'magic-mouth':'Define one actual object and finite spoken message, trigger predicates from available senses, radius, language/sample, duration, repeats versus consumed use and reset. Reconcile Core Instantaneous with persistence. No autonomous creature, remote omniscience, hidden moral/identity test, spell-component caster, infinite message chain or extra magical resource.'}
PENDING_COUNTERPARTS=['prestidigitation','shadow-puppet','shadow-mark','mask-voice','silence']
def sha(p):return hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
def dump(p,d):p.write_text(json.dumps(d,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
def main():
    inherited=json.loads((AUDIT/'LOW_ILLUSION_SPELL_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json').read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
    protected=deepcopy(inherited['protectedFiles']);assert all(sha(GAME/p)==h for p,h in protected.items())
    def read(p):protected[p.relative_to(GAME).as_posix()]=sha(p);return json.loads(p.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
    catalog=read(ROOT/'data/public/spell_playtests/catalog.json');rows=catalog['spells'];by={r['id']:r for r in rows};selected=[r for r in rows if r['operational'] is None and r['schools'][0]=='Universal' and min(v['rank'] for v in r['classAccess'].values())<=2]
    assert len(selected)==23 and {r['id'] for r in selected}==set(QUESTIONS)
    source=read(ROOT/'data/playtest/spell_sources/catalog.json');core=read(ROOT/'data/public/Decennium_Descent_Core_Systems_Data_v2_Known_Descent.json');book=current_book_rows()
    bindings=[]
    for r in selected:
        assert r['source']['original']==source[r['id']]
        for e in r['source']['coreEntries']+r['source']['possibleHistoricalAliases']:assert e['original']==core['spells'][e['index']]
        names={r['name']}|{e['original']['name'] for e in r['source']['possibleHistoricalAliases']}
        for placement in r['source']['original']['placements']:
            matches=[b for b in book if b['name'] in names and b['school']==placement['school'] and b['level']==placement['level']];assert len(matches)==1
            bindings.append({'spellId':r['id'],'catalogPlacement':placement,'currentBookRow':matches[0],'nameDifferencePreserved':placement['name']!=matches[0]['name'],'summaryDifferencePreserved':placement['summary']!=matches[0]['summary']})
    counterparts=[r for r in rows if r['operational'] is not None and 'Universal' in r['schools']]+[by[id] for id in PENDING_COUNTERPARTS]
    mention=read(ROOT/'data/public/spell_playtests/class_name_mentions_for_review.json');mentions=[r for r in mention if r.get('spellId') in QUESTIONS]
    cm=read(ROOT/'data/public/class_playtests/manifest.json');class_map={r['class']:r for r in cm['classes']};class_records=[]
    for m in mentions:
        p=(ROOT/'docs/mechanics'/class_map[m['class']]['data']).resolve();d=read(p)
        cards=[c for c in d['cards'] if c['id']==m['location']];assert len(cards)==1
        class_records.append({'mention':m,'card':cards[0],'engine':d.get('engine',[]),'file':p.relative_to(GAME).as_posix(),'scope':'Complete existing name-comparison card/engine,not an ordinary spell grant or identity merge.'})
    excerpts=deepcopy(inherited['currentGoverningExcerpts'])
    extra={'BUFFER_FEAT_PLAYTEST.md':['Shared rules','Blood Ritual — Magic; Constitution13+ and character level4+','Necrotic Affinity — Magic; Religion proficiency **or** character level8+','Lifeleech — Magic; actual spellcasting ability','Soul Cage feat — Magic; level8+ and (Lifeleech **or** actual spellcasting ability)'],'CREATURE_LIFECYCLE_PLAYTEST.md':['At the table','Different kinds of creature life','Stats and ownership'],'JEWELCRAFTING_RECIPE_PLAYTEST.md':['Charge identity and the dawn clock']}
    for name,heads in extra.items():
        p=ROOT/'docs/mechanics'/name;t=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8');protected[p.relative_to(GAME).as_posix()]=sha(p)
        for h in heads:excerpts.append({'file':p.relative_to(GAME).as_posix(),'sha256':sha(p),'heading':h,'exactText':section(t,h)})
    effect_differences=[{'spellId':r['id'],'catalogEffect':r['source']['original']['description'],'completeCoreRecord':e,'status':'preserved wording difference,not automatically a conflict or amendment'} for r in selected for e in r['source']['coreEntries'] if e['original']['effect']!=r['source']['original']['description']]
    records=[{'spellId':r['id'],'questionId':f'UN-{i+1:02}','fullSourceAndCurrentAccessRecord':r,'recordSha256':digest(r),'individualQuestion':QUESTIONS[r['id']]} for i,r in enumerate(selected)]
    checks=[('23 exact pending low-rank Universal identities',len(records)==23),('No overlap with prior26 Illusion source packet',not set(QUESTIONS).intersection(r['spellId'] for r in inherited['selectedSpells'])),('276 prior operational and572 pending records unchanged',sum(r['operational'] is not None for r in rows)==276 and sum(r['operational'] is None for r in rows)==572),('Every selected full catalog/Core source exact',True),('All23 current book placements bound without discarding differences',len(bindings)==23),('Every selected spell has a full-clause question',all(len(r['individualQuestion'])>190 for r in records)),('20 reviewed andfive pending complete counterpart rows',len(counterparts)==25 and sum(r['operational'] is not None for r in counterparts)==20),('Resonance Tether alias preserved without merge',len(by['resonance-tether']['source']['possibleHistoricalAliases'])==1 and not by['resonance-tether']['source']['coreEntries']),('Echo Cast full catalog/Core wording difference retained',any(r['spellId']=='echo-cast' for r in effect_differences)),('Existing class mention records bound to actual current cards',len(class_records)==len(mentions)==5),('Every governing excerpt exact',all(z['exactText'] in (GAME/z['file']).read_text(encoding='utf-8') for z in excerpts)),('All protected inputs unchanged',all(sha(GAME/p)==h for p,h in protected.items()))]
    assert all(v for _,v in checks),[n for n,v in checks if not v]
    counts={'sourceSpells':848,'operationalSpells':276,'remaining':572,'selectedLowUniversal':23,'selectedExactCoreEntries':sum(len(r['source']['coreEntries']) for r in selected),'selectedAliasRecords':1,'currentBookBindings':len(bindings),'reviewedCounterparts':20,'pendingCounterparts':5,'classComparisonCards':5,'governingExcerpts':len(excerpts),'catalogCoreEffectWordingDifferences':len(effect_differences),'currentBookSummaryDifferences':sum(r['summaryDifferencePreserved'] for r in bindings),'focusedPendingSpellSourcesPrepared':49}
    data={'status':'prepared-not-sent; source questions only','selection':'Remaining primary-Universal identities with minimum current class rank0..2; shared Prestidigitation remains in the Illusion packet','commonOperationalQuestion':inherited['commonOperationalQuestion'],'selectedSpells':records,'currentBookBindings':bindings,'completeCounterparts':counterparts,'classComparisonRecords':class_records,'catalogCoreEffectWordingDifferences':effect_differences,'currentGoverningExcerpts':excerpts,'currentRankCosts':catalog['costByRank'],'currentClassProgression':catalog['classProgression'],'counts':counts,'checks':[{'name':n,'pass':v} for n,v in checks],'protectedFiles':protected,'spellsApproved':0,'sourceInformationDeleted':0,'cosmology':'post-push only; Planar/spectral/rune names grant no cosmology decision; Time Loop stays disabled','futureDispatch':'Finish current Fishing source conference, rebase actual dependencies and send only once. Source decisions precede authoring and separate exact review.'}
    dump(AUDIT/'LOW_UNIVERSAL_SPELL_SOURCE_PREPARATION.json',data)
    lines=['# Low-rank Universal spell source audit','',data['status'],'',data['commonOperationalQuestion'],'','These23 sources complete a second prepared cohort,disjoint from26 low-rank Illusion identities. Source records,22 exact Core entries,one historical Mana Tether alias and23 current-book placements are retained.20 previously operational counterparts,five pending comparisons andfive actual class mention cards provide interfaces without granting new access. Echo Cast retains the catalog/Core RP-versus-base-RP wording difference.','', '| Case | Spell | Full-source question |','|---|---|---|']
    lines += [f"| {r['questionId']} | {r['fullSourceAndCurrentAccessRecord']['name']} ({r['spellId']}) | {r['individualQuestion']} |" for r in records]
    lines+=['','Actual cast identity,one shared RP pool,source-specific costs and stable event order must be discussed for the copying,quickening,redirecting and delaying spells. No automatic recursion prohibition is substituted for the promised finite effect; a usable full effect still needs authoring. No new spell,caster action,resource refund,cosmology or runtime permission follows from preparation. Current totals remain276 operational/572 unfinished;49 pending sources now have focused questions across these two packets.','']
    text='\n'.join(lines);(AUDIT/'LOW_UNIVERSAL_SPELL_SOURCE_AUDIT.md').write_text(text,encoding='utf-8')
    packet='PREPARED LOW-RANK UNIVERSAL SOURCE CONFERENCE — NOT SENT.\n\n'+text+'\nCOMPLETE SOURCE AND CURRENT DEPENDENCY EVIDENCE\n'+json.dumps(data,ensure_ascii=False,separators=(',',':'))
    p=AUDIT/'CODEX_LOW_UNIVERSAL_SPELL_SOURCE_PREPARED.txt';p.write_text(packet,encoding='utf-8',newline='\n')
    status={'status':'prepared-not-sent','packetFile':p.name,'characters':len(packet),'packetSha256':sha(p),'counts':counts,'checkCount':len(checks),'protectedFilesUnchanged':len(protected),'spellsApproved':0,'sourceInformationDeleted':0,'cosmology':'post-push only'};dump(AUDIT/'LOW_UNIVERSAL_SPELL_SOURCE_STATUS.json',status);print(json.dumps(status))
if __name__=='__main__':main()
